<title>USA: King Cty Pub Hosp Dist, 1, Wash., yields 5.65 pct.</title>
<headline>King Cty Pub Hosp Dist, 1, Wash., yields 5.65 pct.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>John Nuveen &amp; Co said it priced $29.615 million of King County Public Hospital District No., 1, Wash., hospital facilities revenue refunding bonds, Series 1997, with a top yield of 5.65 percent in 2015.</p>
</text>
